The parser.rs state machine and relevant portions of mod.rs are translated
from the V8 sources distributed with Node v24.22.1:
https://github.com/nodejs/node/tree/v24.22.1/deps/v8/src/date
The scanner character predicates are based on V8 src/strings/char-predicates*.

